## Reporting Rule (Mandatory Screenshot Attachments)

- **Never post or return a verification summary that lists bare screenshot filenames** (for example `- Home (01-home.png): looks good`) without attaching or embedding the rendered images. A filename without its image is an incomplete verification.
- **GitHub PR comments (`gh pr comment`):** GitHub CLI >= v2.99.0 natively uploads images and videos via `--attach "<path>#<alt>"`. When posting a verification comment to a PR, pair every markdown image tag `![<alt>](<path>)` in `--body` (or `--body-file`) with a matching `--attach "<path>#<alt>"` flag so `gh` uploads the asset to GitHub storage and rewrites the markdown link to the permanent URL:
<!-- kit:if module.openPr -->
  ```bash
  GH_TOKEN=$(gh auth token --user {{GH_ACCOUNT}}) gh pr comment <PR> --repo {{GH_REPO}} \
    --body "### Visual Verification ({{PERSONA_NAME_VERIFIER}})\n\n- **Home**: ![Home screen at 390x844](path/to/01-home.png)\n- **Login**: ![Login screen at 390x844](path/to/02-login.png)" \
    --attach "path/to/01-home.png#Home screen at 390x844" \
    --attach "path/to/02-login.png#Login screen at 390x844"
  ```
<!-- kit:end -->
<!-- kit:if !module.openPr -->
  ```bash
  gh pr comment <PR> --repo <owner/repo> \
    --body "### Visual Verification ({{PERSONA_NAME_VERIFIER}})\n\n- **Home**: ![Home screen at 390x844](path/to/01-home.png)\n- **Login**: ![Login screen at 390x844](path/to/02-login.png)" \
    --attach "path/to/01-home.png#Home screen at 390x844" \
    --attach "path/to/02-login.png#Login screen at 390x844"
  ```
<!-- kit:end -->
- **Chat and artifact reports:** Embed each screenshot directly with markdown image syntax (`![<alt>](/absolute/path/to/01-state.png)`) so {{OWNER}} can see every state inline.

